--------------------------------

To be compatible with openEuler self-developed virtcca
1. vcpu_is_reci() for virtCCA or CCA, _vcpu_is_rec for CCA only.
2. virtCCA and CCA share the macro KVM_ARM_VCPU_REC and reuse the value 8 of virtCCA,
replace the community CCA macro value 9. So the macro KVM_VCPU_MAX_FEATURES of community
also needs to be reduced by 1.
3. Similarly, KVM_CAP_ARM_RME also reuses the value 300 of virtCCA.

